## Upstream attribution

This repository is an aggregation and redistribution source for agent skills.
It does not claim authorship of upstream skill content:

- `skills/mattpocock/` — from https://github.com/mattpocock/skills
- `skills/kill-ai-slop/` — from https://github.com/yetone/kill-ai-slop
- `skills/cloudflare/` — from https://github.com/cloudflare/security-audit-skill
- `skills/self/` — self-authored by the maintainer

Upstream skill content remains the property of its respective authors and is
subject to their own licenses. This MIT license covers the aggregation, the
local adaptation patches tracked in `PATCHES.md`, and the self-authored
skills. See `PATCHES.md` for the exact list of deviations from upstream.